     entity paddle2 = { x: 750, y: 300 };

     on update {
       ball.x += ball.vx;
       ball.y += ball.vy;
       if (ball.x < 0 || ball.x > 800) { vx *= -1; }
     }
   }
   ```

4. **Tap Game** (무한 탭 게임)
   ```
   game TapMaster {
     entity target = random_position();
     int score = 0;

     on tap(x, y) {
       if (distance(target, [x, y]) < 50) {
         score += 1;
         target = random_position();
       }
     }
   }
   ```

5. **Maze Game** (미로 탈출)
   ```
   game Maze {
     entity player = { x: 10, y: 10 };
     entity goal = { x: 390, y: 390 };
     int[][] maze = load_maze();

     on arrow(dir) {
       new_x = player.x + dx[dir];
       new_y = player.y + dy[dir];
       if (maze[new_y][new_x] == 0) {
         player.x = new_x; player.y = new_y;
       }
       if (collision(player, goal)) win = true;
     }
   }
   ```

